INSERT INTO `c_contents` VALUES (6,21,'Smart Hotel Solutions in Bangladesh','Welcome to STATA IT LIMITED, where we are dedicated to providing the best smart hotel solutions in Bangladesh. With our cutting-edge technology and customized approach, we strive to enhance guest experiences, streamline operations, and foster sustainability. STATA IT LIMITED offers seamless integration and scalable solutions tailored to meet the unique needs of hotels across the country.','Introduction','2023-07-31 06:20:18',NULL),(7,16,'Premium Smart Door Lock in Bangladesh','In today\'s increasingly connected world, where technology plays a vital role in our daily lives, it is no surprise that traditional door locks have evolved into smart door locks. These innovative devices offer enhanced security, convenience, and control over access to your Home, Office, Hotel or any other business. In Bangladesh, the demand for premium smart door locks is on the rise as people seek advanced security solutions. STATA IT LIMITED , provides a range of premium smart door locks that offer state-of-the-art features and exceptional performance.','Introduction','2023-07-31 06:44:37',NULL),(8,16,NULL,'Smart door locks are revolutionizing the way we secure our Homes, Offices, Hotels and any other businesses. Unlike traditional locks that rely on physical keys, smart door locks utilize advanced technology such as biometrics, wireless connectivity, and mobile applications to provide a seamless and secure access control system. In Bangladesh, where safety is a priority, premium smart door locks offer an ideal solution for those seeking top-notch security measures.','Benefits of Premium Smart Door Locks','2023-07-31 06:46:53',NULL),(10,16,NULL,'𝐄𝐧𝐡𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞𝐝 𝐒𝐞𝐜𝐮𝐫𝐢𝐭𝐲 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐏𝐞𝐚𝐜𝐞 𝐨𝐟 𝐌𝐢𝐧𝐝',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:05:44',NULL),(11,16,NULL,'One of the key advantages of premium smart door locks is the heightened security they provide. With features such as biometric authentication, encrypted communication, and tamper alarms, these locks offer robust protection against unauthorized access. Whether you are at home or away, you can have peace of mind knowing that your premises are secure.',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:07:23',NULL),(12,16,NULL,'𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐯𝐞𝐧𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐀𝐜𝐜𝐞𝐬𝐬 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐫𝐨𝐥',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:08:10',NULL),(13,16,NULL,'No Tension to carry out the physical key. Premium smart door locks offer convenient access control options such as keypad entry, fingerprint recognition, and even facial recognition. You can grant access to family members, trusted friends, or employees with ease, and revoke access just as effortlessly.',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:08:54',NULL),(14,16,NULL,'𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐒𝐦𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝐇𝐨𝐦𝐞 𝐒𝐲𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐦𝐬',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:09:51',NULL),(15,16,NULL,'Premium smart door locks seamlessly integrate with smart home systems, allowing you to create a connected and automated living environment. You can integrate your smart door lock with other devices such as surveillance cameras, motion sensors, and lighting systems for enhanced security and convenience. For example, you can set up a routine where the lights turn on automatically when the door is unlocked.',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:10:14',NULL),(16,16,NULL,'𝐑𝐞𝐦𝐨𝐭𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐧𝐢𝐭𝐨𝐫𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐫𝐨𝐥',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:11:34',NULL),(17,16,NULL,'With a premium smart door lock, you can monitor and control your door remotely using our mobile app StataLife( Android & Apple ). Forgot to lock the door? No problem. Simply check the status on your smartphone and lock it remotely if necessary. You can also receive notifications whenever someone enters or exits your premises, adding an extra layer of security and awareness.',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:12:04',NULL),(18,16,NULL,'𝐈𝐧𝐜𝐫𝐞𝐚𝐬𝐞𝐝 𝐄𝐧𝐞𝐫𝐠𝐲 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐲',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:13:19',NULL),(19,16,NULL,'Premium smart door locks often come with energy-saving features. For instance, some models automatically lock the door after a certain period of time to conserve energy and ensure security. This eliminates the risk of accidentally leaving the door unlocked and helps lower your overall energy consumption.',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:13:49',NULL),(20,16,NULL,NULL,'Features to Look for in Premium Smart Door Locks','2023-07-31 07:15:13',NULL),(21,16,NULL,'When choosing a premium smart door lock, it is essential to consider the following features:',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:15:47',NULL),(22,16,NULL,'𝐁𝐢𝐨𝐦𝐞𝐭𝐫𝐢𝐜 𝐀𝐮𝐭𝐡𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:16:24',NULL),(23,16,NULL,'Look for models that offer biometric authentication methods such as fingerprint recognition or facial recognition. These features provide a high level of security and ensure that only authorized individuals can access your property.',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:17:31',NULL),(24,16,NULL,'𝐊𝐞𝐲𝐥𝐞𝐬𝐬 𝐄𝐧𝐭𝐫𝐲 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:18:45',NULL),(25,16,NULL,'Keyless entry options such as keypad or touchpad entry allow for convenient access without the need for physical keys. This feature is particularly useful when you are going for a run or a walk and do not want to carry keys with you.',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:19:28',NULL),(26,16,NULL,'𝐀𝐝𝐯𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞𝐝 𝐄𝐧𝐜𝐫𝐲𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐒𝐞𝐜𝐮𝐫𝐢𝐭𝐲 𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐭𝐨𝐜𝐨𝐥𝐬',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:20:06',NULL),(27,16,NULL,'Ensure that the smart door lock you choose employs advanced encryption and security protocols to protect against hacking or unauthorized access. Look for models that adhere to industry standards and have a proven track record of security.',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:20:42',NULL),(28,16,NULL,'𝐌𝐨𝐛𝐢𝐥𝐞 𝐀𝐩𝐩 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:25:19',NULL),(29,16,NULL,'Opt for smart door locks that offer seamless integration with mobile apps. A dedicated mobile app allows you to control and monitor your door lock remotely, receive notifications, and grant access to guests even when you are not at home.',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:26:08',NULL),(30,16,NULL,'𝐁𝐚𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐲 𝐋𝐢𝐟𝐞 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐏𝐨𝐰𝐞𝐫 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:26:48',NULL),(31,16,NULL,'Consider the battery life of the smart door lock and the power options available. Look for models that have long battery life or offer alternative power options such as backup batteries or solar power. This ensures that your door lock remains functional even during power outages.',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:27:13',NULL),(32,16,NULL,NULL,'Top Premium Smart Door Lock Price in Bangladesh','2023-07-31 07:27:55',NULL),(33,16,NULL,'In Bangladesh, several top-notch brands offer premium smart door locks with exceptional features and performance. Here are three models worth considering:',NULL,'2023-07-31 07:28:18',NULL),(34,16,NULL,NULL,'Brand: STATA','2023-07-31 09:02:58',NULL),(36,16,NULL,'● Smart Door lock STATA Bolt Pro price in Bangladesh = 424999/-',NULL,'2023-07-31 09:05:36',NULL),(37,16,NULL,'● Smart Door Lock STATA X9 Plus price in Bangladesh = 27999/-',NULL,'2023-07-31 09:05:49',NULL),(38,16,NULL,'● Smart Door lock STATA TAP Pro price in Bangladesh = 13999/-',NULL,'2023-07-31 09:06:06',NULL),(39,16,NULL,NULL,'Choosing the Right Premium Smart Door Lock for Your Needs','2023-07-31 09:07:33',NULL),(40,16,NULL,'Choosing the right premium smart door lock requires careful consideration of your specific requirements. For choosing the right smart door lock, here are some instruction:',NULL,'2023-07-31 09:08:10',NULL),(41,16,NULL,'𝐀𝐬𝐬𝐞𝐬𝐬𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐘𝐨𝐮𝐫 𝐒𝐞𝐜𝐮𝐫𝐢𝐭𝐲 𝐑𝐞𝐪𝐮𝐢𝐫𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐬',NULL,'2023-07-31 09:08:47',NULL),(42,16,NULL,'Evaluate the level of security you need for your premises. Consider factors such as the location, potential threats, and the number of individuals who require access. This assessment will help you determine the features and capabilities you require in a smart door lock.',NULL,'2023-07-31 09:09:49',NULL),(43,16,NULL,'𝐂𝐨𝐦𝐩𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐛𝐢𝐥𝐢𝐭𝐲 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐄𝐱𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐫𝐚𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐮𝐜𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞',NULL,'2023-07-31 09:10:15',NULL),(44,16,NULL,'If you already have a smart home system or other connected devices, ensure that the smart door lock you choose is compatible with your existing infrastructure. This compatibility allows for seamless integration and an enhanced user experience.',NULL,'2023-07-31 09:10:42',NULL),(45,16,NULL,'𝐁𝐮𝐝𝐠𝐞𝐭 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐬𝐢𝐝𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬',NULL,'2023-07-31 09:11:19',NULL),(46,16,NULL,'Set a budget for your smart door lock purchase. While premium options may come with a higher price tag, they often offer advanced features and better build quality. It is very important to balance price between budget and quality.',NULL,'2023-07-31 09:11:40',NULL),(47,16,NULL,'𝐂𝐮𝐬𝐭𝐨𝐦𝐞𝐫 𝐒𝐮𝐩𝐩𝐨𝐫𝐭 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐖𝐚𝐫𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐲',NULL,'2023-07-31 09:12:07',NULL),(48,16,NULL,'Research the customer support reputation of the brand you choose. Look for brands that offer reliable customer support and a good warranty policy. This ensures that you can seek assistance if any issues arise or if you require help with installation or troubleshooting.',NULL,'2023-07-31 09:12:41',NULL),(51,16,NULL,NULL,'Installation and Maintenance of Premium Smart Door Locks','2023-07-31 09:16:09',NULL),(52,16,NULL,'When it comes to installing a premium smart door lock, you have two options: professional installation or DIY installation. Our professional expert team will ensure that the lock is installed correctly and functioning properly. If you choose the DIY route, carefully follow the manufacturer\'s instructions and seek assistance if needed.',NULL,'2023-07-31 09:16:39',NULL),(53,16,NULL,'Regular maintenance is crucial for the longevity and performance of your smart door lock. Follow the manufacturer\'s recommendations for maintenance and software updates. This ensures that your lock remains secure and operates smoothly.',NULL,'2023-07-31 09:17:04',NULL),(54,16,NULL,'𝐅𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐲, Investing in a premium smart door lock in Bangladesh offers a multitude of benefits, including enhanced security, convenient access control, and integration with smart home systems. By choosing a reputable brand and considering your specific requirements, you can find the perfect smart door lock for your needs. Visit STATA IT LIMITED to explore a range of premium smart door locks and make an informed decision for a safer and smarter Home, Office, Hotel or any other business.',NULL,'2023-07-31 09:20:06',NUL